implications_for_automation:
Do not let the agent auto-ship on '95% chance to win' with daily peeks. Simulated A/A false positives reach about 40%. Use one of:
(a) a pre-registered fixed horizon computed from MDE tables;
(b) always-valid confidence sequences (PostHog or GrowthBook) with N* set to the expected sample;
(c) a group-sequential plan with 3–4 pre-specified looks.
Also require at least 7 days runtime to cover weekday cycles.
